WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
The constraint is visible
in the team model.

00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:07.120
Seventy-five people work across five
squads, and forty-five focus on manual

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:11.920
and domain testing. They depend on limited
shared environments and vendor test slots.

00:00:12.023 --> 00:00:15.920
Adding people does not automatically
create more execution capacity.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.440
The proposed pilot draws eight
people from this organization.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.960
The opportunity is to make
their work easier to repeat,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.760
review and reuse, while keeping domain
knowledge close to the decisions.
